("v488", "scalar", "<div class=\"world-encounter\" data-world-type=\"weights\"><p class=\"encounter-label\">THE WEIGHT DESK / DECLARED TOY QUANTITIES</p><p class=\"world-intro\">Scores: speed / thoroughness. Each plan is good at a different thing.</p><div class=\"weight-options\"><div><span>OPTION A</span><strong>8 / 2</strong></div><div><span>OPTION B</span><strong>2 / 8</strong></div></div><p class=\"equation-note\">Score = w × speed + (1 − w) × thoroughness</p><label class=\"range-label\" for=\"weight-input\">How much should speed count? <output id=\"weight-label\">50%</output></label><input class=\"world-range\" id=\"weight-input\" data-world-input=\"weights\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"50\"><div class=\"weight-scores\"><span>A <output id=\"score-a\">5.00</output></span><span>B <output id=\"score-b\">5.00</output></span></div><div class=\"world-result\" id=\"world-result\" aria-live=\"polite\">The two plans have the same score with these priorities.</div><p class=\"world-note\">INVENTED NUMBERS · NO PEOPLE OR OUTCOMES ARE SCORED</p></div>")
